  CENTERED  C(r,d) = C(r+1,d-1) - C(r-1,d-1) support r = d+1..R-d
  centered normalisation: UNNORMALISED — the factor 1/2 in (S - S^-1)/2 is
  omitted so every entry is an exact integer; a positive scalar per depth
  cannot move zeros.
  ARITHMETIC: exact Python int throughout. numpy is deliberately NOT imported.

